  A solitaire white gold ring keeps every eye on one diamond, set in a cool, reflective metal that lets the stone do the talking. This collection brings together Lucira's solitaire rings, bands, and pendants available in 14KT and 18KT white gold, each set with a certified lab-grown diamond and priced with full transparency on gold rate, purity, and diamond value. Why a Solitaire Looks Sharper in White Gold White gold's cool, silvery tone mirrors a diamond's natural sparkle more closely than yellow or rose gold, which is why it remains the most requested metal for solitaire settings in India. There is no warm undertone competing with the stone's colour grade, so a G to H colour diamond reads brighter and cleaner in white gold than in a warmer metal. Compared with platinum, white gold offers a similar bright, white finish at a lower cost per gram, since platinum is denser and usually carries a higher making charge. For buyers who want the platinum look without the platinum price, white gold is the practical middle ground. Best-Performing Solitaire White Gold Styles Based on the last 90 days of on-site browsing and add-to-cart data, these are the solitaire styles, all available in white gold, that shoppers are engaging with the most: Rank Style Category Why Shoppers Pick It 1 Prong-Set Solitaire Lab-Grown Diamond Ring Men's Ring Highest add-to-cart rate in the solitaire range 2 Princess Cut Pave Solitaire Engagement Ring Women's Ring Strong pull among princess-cut engagement shoppers 3 Signature Euro Solitaire Ring Men's Ring Structured Euro shank drives repeat views and saves 4 Stackable Round-Cut Solitaire Wedding Ring Wedding Ring Works as a standalone band or stacked with an engagement ring 5 Two-Tone Prong-Set Solitaire Band Men's Ring Two-tone detailing on a white gold base is a fast-growing search 6 Forever Solitaire Couple Band, For Her Women's Ring Popular as part of a matching couple set 7 4 Prong Round Solitaire Engagement Ring, 6mm Women's Ring Classic four